w source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers#Ketheric's_room\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Ketheric's Room</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-164&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-178</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers_Prison\" title=\"Moonrise Towers Prison\">Moonrise Towers Prison</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;581&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-655</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A map of the Sword Coast, from the Sea of Moving Ice down to just north of Amn, including several of the nearer archipelagoes in the Sea of Swords. A large red arrow stretches out from the east, then branches into numerous small arrows, fanning out across the land to signify the Absolute's planned conquest.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17934/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument